          "startingColumn": 26,
          "startingLine": 16
        }
      },
      {
        "comment": "",
        "key": "The model service may process data outside your country, including in mainland China, depending on your deployment region. The gateway requests store:false for response history; other provider logs and retention are governed by applicable provider terms. Do not send sensitive information.",
